# Probe (not committed): does a page key with a modifier page the full
# transcript? fulltranscript.cap up to its `full` snap, then Ctrl-PageUp
# (`CSI 5 ; 5 ~`), Caps-Lock-PageUp (`CSI 5 ; 65 ~`), and the bare PageUp.
fx: gateway fulltranscript-fx.json
xfx: gateway fulltranscript-xfx.json
work toolgroup-ws
fx: seed toolgroup-ask-settings.json
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
wait 2
type run the checks
key Enter
wait 2.5
key 1
wait 2.5
key 1
wait 3
key C-o
wait 1
snap full
key -H 1b 5b 35 3b 35 7e
wait 0.8
snap full-ctrl-pgup
key -H 1b 5b 35 3b 36 35 7e
wait 0.8
snap full-caps-pgup
key -H 1b 5b 35 3b 31 7e
wait 0.8
snap full-pgup-1
key -H 1b 5b 35 7e
wait 0.8
snap full-pgup
